        {
          "left": "295.0px",
          "top": "205.0px",
          "width": "465.0px",
          "height": "115.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif; background:#f8fafc; border-left:4px solid #09090b; padding:14px 18px; border-radius:0 6px 6px 0; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2px; color:#09090b; margin-bottom:6px;'>EXECUTIVE PROFILE</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55;'>Results-driven leader with 9+ years of specialized experience delivering high-impact initiatives, mentoring top-performing teams, and driving measurable operational excellence across fast-paced environments.</div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 5,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "295.0px",
          "top": "342.0px",
          "width": "465.0px",
          "height": "530.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif;'><div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2.5px; color:#09090b; border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:18px;'>PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #a855f7; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Principal Creative Technologist — Apple Design Group</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#09090b; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2022 - PRESENT</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Prototyped spatial computing gestures, volumetric shaders, and interactive 3D environments for visionOS flagship apps.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #a855f7; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Interactive Director — teamLab Tokyo</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#09090b; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2019 - 2022</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Engineered real-time particle projection mapping installations experienced by 3.2M museum visitors worldwide.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #a855f7; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Senior Frontend Graphics Engineer — Vercel</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#09090b; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2017 - 2019</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Built WebGL developer experience showcases and high-frame-rate UI animation primitives.</div></div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
